 "description": "Larbat2016.1 - Modeling the diversion of primary carbon flux into secondary metabolism under variable nitrate and light or dark conditions (Base Model)\nBioModels BIOMD0000000857 (curated). SBML file: Larbat2016.1.xml.\nSimulation: 0 to 200 time units (SED-ML: Larbat2016.1.sedml), sampling 0.2.\nRun switches: -ig:mass -INT:1 -obeymaxint\nVerification against libRoadRunner (SBML reference): PASS, max |difference| = 4.14e-06 of species peak (worst: sucr)\nSBML time units are used unchanged as Kintecus seconds.\nConversion notes:\n  [info] EtrioseP_Consumption_Sucrose: rate is not proportional to its reactants; divided form used with 1/(c+1e-30) so an empty species is not consumed\n  [info] Ephe_Consumption: rate is not proportional to its reactants; divided form used with 1/(c+1e-30) so an empty species is not consumed\n  [info] Enitrate_Consumption: rate is not proportional to its reactants; divided form used with 1/(c+1e-30) so an empty species is not consumed\n  [info] Estarch_Consumption: rate is not proportional to its reactants; divided form used with 1/(c+1e-30) so an empty species is not consumed",
